message: "If you use this code, data, or figures, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "RepFix: Silent Scale Shift — Variance Contraction and Calibrated Readout Failure"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, per-seed result files, and run logs for the paper
  "Silent Scale Shift: Variance Contraction Breaks Calibrated Readouts".  The
  repository contains the training and evaluation code, the per-table
  configuration files and seed lists, the post-submission audits, and the raw
  per-seed results from which every number reported in the paper can be recomputed.
